### KlimateX API: every call, in the order of the demo.
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (or JetBrains HTTP client) and click "Send Request".
### Switch @base to the live address after deploying.

@base = http://localhost:8080
# @base = https://team20.xtradot.co

# Paste the access_token from a login below. Roles: admin, auditor, buyer, adaeze (household), installer, lender.
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Sign in (the password is DEMO_PASSWORD)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@demo.klimatex.test", "password": "your-demo-password" }

### Health
GET {{base}}/healthz

### Can the pod reach the bank sandbox? (live only)
GET {{base}}/api/sandbox/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register our webhook (live only; copy webhook_secret from the reply)
POST {{base}}/api/sandbox/register-webhook
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── The whole story in one call ──
POST {{base}}/api/demo/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── Or step by step ──

### 1. Seed 20 Surulere homes, Jan to Jun 2026
POST {{base}}/api/sim/seed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Open a monitoring period
POST {{base}}/api/periods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "start": "2026-01-01", "end": "2026-06-30" }

### 3. Compute tonnes and run the nine checks
POST {{base}}/api/periods/1/compute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. See every home's result
GET {{base}}/api/periods/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Draw the auditor's sample (visible seed)
POST {{base}}/api/periods/1/sample?seed=42
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Review a sampled home (repeat for each id in the sample)
POST {{base}}/api/periods/1/sites/3/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decision": "ok", "note": "evidence consistent" }

### 6b. Keep a clone-pair home held
POST {{base}}/api/periods/1/sites/4/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decision": "keep_held", "note": "clone pair, needs a site visit" }

### 7. Sign off and mint credits
POST {{base}}/api/periods/1/signoff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Credits for sale
GET {{base}}/api/credits?status=listed

### 9. Buyer reserves 10 credits (open payment_url to pay with the test card)
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tonnes": 10 }

### 10. Confirm: verify payment, retire, split, pay (safe to call twice)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. The order, its certificate and every payout
GET {{base}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── Household app ──
GET {{base}}/api/homes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/homes/12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/homes/12/certificate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Monthly message (lang: en, pcm, yo, ig, ha)
GET {{base}}/api/homes/12/message?lang=pcm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── Public verify page ──
GET {{base}}/api/verify/KX-NG-2026-LAG01-000001

###
GET {{base}}/api/ledger/verify
